A file whose frontmatter block never closes cannot be read into a row: the run keeps going,
returns the other two files, exits 0, and names the skipped file in a single stderr warning
that never reaches stdout.

-- fixtures/cwd/.booping --
project_name: probe
vault_path: ./vault
-- fixtures/cwd/vault/plans/alpha/index.md --
---
title: Alpha
status: ready-for-dev
---

body
-- fixtures/cwd/vault/plans/beta/index.md --
---
title: Beta
status: done
---

body
-- fixtures/cwd/vault/plans/broken/index.md --
---
title: Broken

body
-- cmd --
booping query --glob 'plans/*/index.md' --output paths
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
plans/alpha/index.md
plans/beta/index.md
-- stderr --
warning: skipping {CWD}/vault/plans/broken/index.md — unparseable frontmatter ([..])
